## 2. Blocked on a later phase

### BLK-1 · Image tool · OPEN (unblocked) · from P3.4
**Unblocked by P4.1** — the asset store now exists and is content-addressed.
Still needs: a file input on the toolbar, `FabricImage` construction from
`objectUrlFor`, retain/release wired to node add/delete, and asset bytes
collected into `packProject` (currently hardcoded to an empty array in
`FileMenu.buildBytes`).

- **Accept:** upload an image, place it, resize it; the asset survives a
  `.toke` save/open round trip; two placements of the same file store one blob.

### BLK-2 · Pen / path tool · BLOCKED by P8.2 · from P3.4
`PathNode` and the Fabric mapping exist; the drawing interaction does not.
Large interaction (anchors, bezier handles), and there is no PDF path renderer
to target until P8.2, so it cannot be verified end to end.

### BLK-3 · Token-bound indicator in the layers tree · OPEN (unblocked) · from P3.10
**Unblocked by P6.** `isTokenised(node.text)` now answers this. `LayersPanel`
still hardcodes `const bound = false`; the inspector shows a bound badge but
the layer tree does not. Render the `--bound` colour **plus** a text label —
CLAUDE.md §4.7 forbids signalling state by colour alone.

### BLK-4 · Diagnostics panel wiring · BLOCKED by P9.2 · from P2.1, P3
Errors currently surface as one-off `role="alert"` paragraphs. Every
`AppError` already carries `objectId`; nothing consumes it yet.

- **Accept:** every error reaches the diagnostics panel, and clicking one with
  an `objectId` selects that canvas object.

